==Battleground==
*3 [[Wall Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Wall Doge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*3 [[Wall Doge]]s spawn after 96.67 seconds<sup>2,900f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*3 [[Wall Doge]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 136.67 seconds<sup>4,100f</sup>, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
These Enemies are quite strong so strong meatshields are recommended to have. Try and kill the first few Wall Doges with [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] quickly and then spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] which should continuously knock back the Aku Gories until you are eventually at the base.

